'' A COMMON ARRAY'S DESCRIPTOR IS TENTATIVE ON ELF TOO: zero-filled and 'common', so the
'' linker merges each module's copy. The 96 is a rank-2 descriptor, 240 the unknown rank's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --emit-ir -target linux-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/common-array-main.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: @"GINTS$" = common global [240 x i8] zeroinitializer
'' EXPECT-OUT: @"GTEXT$" = common global [240 x i8] zeroinitializer
'' EXPECT-OUT: @"GGRID$" = common global [96 x i8] zeroinitializer
